MaildirStore local
Path ~/Maildir/
Inbox ~/Maildir/INBOX/
SubFolders Verbatim

IMAPAccount fastmail
Host imap.fastmail.com
TLSType IMAPS
User z@bcc32.com
PassCmd "cat ~/src/dotfiles-private/offlineimap/password.txt"
# TODO separate password file

IMAPStore remote-fastmail
Account fastmail

Channel local-remote-fastmail
Near :local:
Far :remote-fastmail:
Pattern *
# treat remote as source of truth for directories
Create Near
Remove Near
# https://vxlabs.com/2021/03/21/mbsync-copyarrivaldate-yes/
# For Fastmail
CopyArrivalDate yes
